        {
          "text": "’Dini Yosua opa di angu ’diyi dria, angu oni ruaari pi, angu dria Uruleruri pi, angu dria Goseniari pi, angu senderuri pi, Araba pi, angu oniru Israelini pi, a ’bu erini pie dria; ",
