        {
          "text": "opa angu dria engazu oni Halaki dri fepi tuzu Seiriariasi cazu kpere Baali-gadi ovupi a’bu Lebanoninia oni Herimoni ma etiaria dria. Obi opi yini dria, o’di yi, ofu yi ra. ",
